<title>UK: Brent Walker has Pubmaster preferred bidder.</title>
<headline>Brent Walker has Pubmaster preferred bidder.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent Walker Plc said on Friday that it had chosen a preferred bidder to buy its Pubmaster subsidiary, but gave no name in a short statement.</p>
<p>It said that negotiations about the chain of public houses were continuing and further details would be announced in due course.</p>
</text>
